msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wish I knew how all these uninvited souls kept finding their way to my mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이상한걸, ⟪k:3⟫또 부른 적 없는 자가 오다니."

#: omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a03789ac14beba4de895bfc129639693f2be69ada65349b132d70e7f72b3bf2
