msgctxt "omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you just completed the game and would like some time to dwell on it, you are welcome "
"to head back now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫즉 본편 분위기가 와르르 무너지는 곳이란 뜻이지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫만약 ⟪k:4⟫네가 여운에 잠기고 싶"
"다면 ⟪k:5⟫한 번 나갔다 와도 돼."

#: omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c8526738df22aa49c2db6c304a3ad46ce9c27460321b5cf3d483d5833c41e79
#. default-sha256: 70f136a3ed6990920923a872d1384d308837a78aeda1c6680275e265336d5816
msgctxt "omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ll see people who shouldn’t be here. Things that contradict the events of the game. "
"A general sense of pandemonium. You’d do best not to think much of any of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫없어야 할 사람이 있는 등, ⟪k:2⟫카오스한 상태겠는데, ⟪k:3⟫자잘한 건 신경 쓰면 안 돼."

#: omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2826c92c1b881032dc7534ba15c13d42a52e9dec8df9c64dc28c8f280834103
