msgstr "⟪k:0⟫장발이란 점에 큰 의의를 두진 않습니다……."

#: omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea8b527d1e3322ceeb4d53a59bda63a565ed1f753df81a3c76b81bc2abbb6080
